[I] A Webmail server using maildirs

[T] SqWebMail is the Webmail module that's bundled with the Courier
[T] mail server. It can also be packaged separately and used with any
[T] other mail server that uses maildirs. SqWebMail does support
[T] traditional Mailbox files, only Maildirs. It accesses maildirs
[T] directly, and does not use an IMAP server.

[U] http://www.courier-mta.org/sqwebmail/main.html

[A] Mr. Sam <mrsam@courier-mta.com>
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/network

[L] GPL
[V] 7.0.3

[D] b420908d471ad575c9a551b7ec70fd27da909cf2460a0084bd64ed63 sqwebmail-7.0.3.tar.bz2 https://prdownloads.sourceforge.net/sourceforge/courier/

var_append confopt ' ' --enable-imagedir=$datadir/$pkg/images
var_append confopt ' ' --with-notice=unicode
var_append confopt ' ' --enable-cgibindir=$datadir/$pkg/cgi-bin
pkginstalled courier-imap && var_append patchfiles ' ' $confdir/cimap-sharedfiles.diff
